<name>Power Window System</name>
<para id="RM0000005EB00SX" category="J" type-id="30129" name-id="752B6-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Remote Operation of Other Windows by Master Switch Is Not Possible (Operation by Each Door Switch Is Possible)</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000005EB00SX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000024400000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When the IG is ON, the power window regulator master switch assembly sends the remote switch signals for the other seats on the power window regulator master switch assembly to the power window regulator motor assembly of each seat. The power window regulator motor assembly that receives the signal operates based on the signal.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005EB00SX_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000024500000">
